"- button \"关闭窗口\"\n- button \"最小化窗口\"\n- button \"缩放窗口\"\n- tablist \"Workspace surface\":\n  - tab \"Echo\" [selected]:\n    - generic: Echo\n  - tab \"AI 浏览器\":\n- button \"收起侧栏 (⌘B)\" [expanded]:\n- button \"新建任务\":\n  - generic: 新建任务\n- list:\n  - link \"HUB\":\n    - /url: \"#/workspace/agents?surface=chat\"\n    - generic: HUB\n  - link \"助手\":\n    - /url: \"#/workspace/realtime/octopus-assistant?agent=octopus\"\n    - generic: 助手\n  - link \"订阅\":\n    - /url: \"#/workspace/intelligence?surface=chat\"\n    - generic: 订阅\n  - link \"项目管理\":\n    - /url: \"#/workspace/projects\"\n    - generic: 项目管理\n  - link \"设计画布\":\n    - /url: \"#/workspace/design\"\n    - generic: 设计画布\n  - link \"叙事工坊\":\n    - /url: \"#/workspace/narrative\"\n    - generic: 叙事工坊\n  - link \"自进化\":\n    - /url: \"#/workspace/evolution?surface=chat\"\n    - generic: 自进化\n- list:\n  - link \"发现社区\":\n    - /url: \"#/workspace/community\"\n    - generic: 发现社区\n- list:\n  - button \"展开本地数据库\":\n    - generic: 本地数据库\n- list:\n  - button \"编辑侧栏\":\n- button \"收起项目\" [expanded]:\n  - generic: 项目\n- button \"选择项目空间\":\n- button \"live-codex-workspace 5\":\n  - generic: live-codex-workspace\n  - generic: \"5\"\n- button \"更多：live-codex-workspace\":\n- button \"收起对话\" [expanded]:\n  - generic: 对话\n- button \"对话 · 新建任务\":\n- list:\n  - link \"研究eight sleep专利布局方向 1h\":\n    - /url: \"#/workspace/realtime/tVzjQc51k71eLx8xYMQu1j\"\n    - generic: 研究eight sleep专利布局方向\n    - generic: 1h\n  - button \"更多\":\n  - link \"调研智能睡眠 5h\":\n    - /url: \"#/workspace/realtime/tnwquwTzTuEqf3gj5PD4hm\"\n    - generic: 调研智能睡眠\n    - generic: 5h\n  - button \"更多\":\n- button \"Eve\":\n  - generic: Eve\n- button \"设置\":\n- main:\n  - complementary:\n    - heading \"架构探索\" [level=1]\n    - paragraph: docs/architecture/ 下的手写设计文档 · Mermaid 代码块自动渲染\n    - navigation:\n      - generic: 入口\n      - list:\n        - button \"README · 入口\"\n        - button \"核心路径 5+3+5+6\"\n      - generic: 高清图\n      - list:\n        - button \"高清架构图 (ASCII)\"\n        - button \"高清架构图 (Mermaid)\"\n      - generic: 专题\n      - list:\n        - button \"Chat 模式对照\"\n        - button \"ReAct 自进化闭环\"\n        - button \"器官分层(维护)\" [active]\n        - button \"模块地图\"\n      - generic: 核心器官\n      - list:\n        - button \"🧠 Cerebrum · 中枢脑\"\n        - button \"🧬 Ganglia · 神经节\"\n        - button \"🐦 Beak · 工具执行\"\n        - button \"❤️ Hearts · 调度 facade\"\n        - button \"🎨 Chromatophores · arm 广播\"\n  - main:\n    - heading \"器官分层 · 数字不是契约，分层才是\" [level=1]\n    - blockquote:\n      - paragraph:\n        - text: 本文不是推翻\n        - link \"naming.md\":\n          - /url: /naming.md\n        - text: 和\n        - link \"vision/biomimetic-architecture.md\":\n          - /url: /vision/biomimetic-architecture.md\n        - text: —— 那两份文档里\"数字是诗意不是契约\"的原则已经写得很好。\n      - paragraph: 本文做的是下一步：把 22 个器官再切三层，声明清楚哪些是一等公民、 哪些是辅助器官、哪些其实是基础设施只是恰好起了个生物名。\n      - paragraph: 目的：新同学上来能一眼看出核心在哪；新增功能知道该不该开新器官。\n    - separator\n    - heading \"为什么需要分层\" [level=2]\n    - paragraph: 22 器官 flat 列表会产生两个问题：\n    - list:\n      - text: 规模失衡隐形 ——\n      - code: sensing/siphon\n      - text: 10k 行跟\n      - code: safety/ink\n      - text: 300 行在同一张表里并列， 看不出核心 vs 外围\n      - listitem: 新功能强塞 —— 每次加新东西都要想\"挂到哪个器官\"， 而 gene-locks / RecipeForge 这种跨器官治理本来就不该是器官\n    - paragraph: 分层后，上述两个问题变成：\n    - list:\n      - listitem: 一等公民表 8 行，工程边界 = 叙事边界\n      - listitem: 新功能先问三个问题（见下方），答不过就不开新器官\n    - separator\n    - heading \"三层模型\" [level=2]\n    - heading \"一等公民 · Primary Organs （8 个）\" [level=3]\n    - blockquote:\n      - paragraph: 领域核心 · 独立演化节奏 · 独立依赖边界 · 独立失败模式。 重构这些 = 重构项目。\n    - button \"Copy table as markdown\":\n    - button \"Download table\":\n    - table:\n      - rowgroup:\n        - row \"器官 路径 工程名 规模 核心职责\":\n          - columnheader \"器官\"\n          - columnheader \"路径\"\n          - columnheader \"工程名\"\n          - columnheader \"规模\"\n          - columnheader \"核心职责\"\n      - rowgroup:\n        - row \"cerebrum runtime/core/cerebrum/ Planner ~2.6k LOC 慢路径规划、LLM 调度\":\n          - cell \"cerebrum\":\n            - code: cerebrum\n          - cell \"runtime/core/cerebrum/\":\n            - code: runtime/core/cerebrum/\n          - cell \"Planner\":\n            - code: Planner\n          - cell \"~2.6k LOC\"\n          - cell \"慢路径规划、LLM 调度\"\n        - row \"spinal_cord runtime/core/spinal_cord/ ReflexRouter ~3.3k LOC <50ms 快路径反射\":\n          - cell \"spinal_cord\":\n            - code: spinal_cord\n          - cell \"runtime/core/spinal_cord/\":\n            - code: runtime/core/spinal_cord/\n          - cell \"ReflexRouter\":\n            - code: ReflexRouter\n          - cell \"~3.3k LOC\"\n          - cell \"<50ms 快路径反射\"\n        - row \"ganglia runtime/core/ganglia/ LocalRuntime ~0.3k LOC TaskGraph DAG 执行\":\n          - cell \"ganglia\":\n            - code: ganglia\n          - cell \"runtime/core/ganglia/\":\n            - code: runtime/core/ganglia/\n          - cell \"LocalRuntime\":\n            - code: LocalRuntime\n          - cell \"~0.3k LOC\"\n          - cell \"TaskGraph DAG 执行\"\n        - row \"eyes runtime/sensing/eyes/ Perception / ModelRouter ~1.7k LOC 输入解析 + 模型路由\":\n          - cell \"eyes\":\n            - code: eyes\n          - cell \"runtime/sensing/eyes/\":\n            - code: runtime/sensing/eyes/\n          - cell \"Perception / ModelRouter\":\n            - code: Perception\n            - text: /\n            - code: ModelRouter\n          - cell \"~1.7k LOC\"\n          - cell \"输入解析 + 模型路由\"\n        - row \"suckers runtime/execution/suckers/ SkillRegistry ~5.8k LOC 技能库（21 skill）\":\n          - cell \"suckers\":\n            - code: suckers\n          - cell \"runtime/execution/suckers/\":\n            - code: runtime/execution/suckers/\n          - cell \"SkillRegistry\":\n            - code: SkillRegistry\n          - cell \"~5.8k LOC\"\n          - cell \"技能库（21 skill）\"\n        - row \"beak runtime/execution/beak/ ToolExecutor ~0.8k LOC 工具参数化执行\":\n          - cell \"beak\":\n            - code: beak\n          - cell \"runtime/execution/beak/\":\n            - code: runtime/execution/beak/\n          - cell \"ToolExecutor\":\n            - code: ToolExecutor\n          - cell \"~0.8k LOC\"\n          - cell \"工具参数化执行\"\n        - row \"genome runtime/memory/genome/ Journal / Checkpointer ~1.4k LOC 持久化 / 长时记忆\":\n          - cell \"genome\":\n            - code: genome\n          - cell \"runtime/memory/genome/\":\n            - code: runtime/memory/genome/\n          - cell \"Journal / Checkpointer\":\n            - code: Journal\n            - text: /\n            - code: Checkpointer\n          - cell \"~1.4k LOC\"\n          - cell \"持久化 / 长时记忆\"\n        - row \"hemolymph runtime/memory/hemolymph/ ContextComposer ~0.3k LOC 每轮上下文装配\":\n          - cell \"hemolymph\":\n            - code: hemolymph\n          - cell \"runtime/memory/hemolymph/\":\n            - code: runtime/memory/hemolymph/\n          - cell \"ContextComposer\":\n            - code: ContextComposer\n          - cell \"~0.3k LOC\"\n          - cell \"每轮上下文装配\"\n    - paragraph: 特征：这 8 个里任意一个被抽掉，项目不成立。\n    - heading \"辅助器官 · Secondary Organs （8 个）\" [level=3]\n    - blockquote:\n      - paragraph: 职责清晰、命名合理，但调用面比一等公民窄。 升级或替换它们不会改变项目的核心形态。\n    - button \"Copy table as markdown\":\n    - button \"Download table\":\n    - table:\n      - rowgroup:\n        - row \"器官 路径 工程名 规模 当前评估\":\n          - columnheader \"器官\"\n          - columnheader \"路径\"\n          - columnheader \"工程名\"\n          - columnheader \"规模\"\n          - columnheader \"当前评估\"\n      - rowgroup:\n        - row \"arms runtime/execution/arms/ Worker ~0.8k LOC worker 实例层\":\n          - cell \"arms\":\n            - code: arms\n          - cell \"runtime/execution/arms/\":\n            - code: runtime/execution/arms/\n          - cell \"Worker\":\n            - code: Worker\n          - cell \"~0.8k LOC\"\n          - cell \"worker 实例层\"\n        - row \"mantle runtime/sensing/mantle/ Sandbox ~1.3k LOC 执行沙箱\":\n          - cell \"mantle\":\n            - code: mantle\n          - cell \"runtime/sensing/mantle/\":\n            - code: runtime/sensing/mantle/\n          - cell \"Sandbox\":\n            - code: Sandbox\n          - cell \"~1.3k LOC\"\n          - cell \"执行沙箱\"\n        - row \"immunity runtime/safety/immunity/ TrustEngine ~0.9k LOC 身份 / 风控\":\n          - cell \"immunity\":\n            - code: immunity\n          - cell \"runtime/safety/immunity/\":\n            - code: runtime/safety/immunity/\n          - cell \"TrustEngine\":\n            - code: TrustEngine\n          - cell \"~0.9k LOC\"\n          - cell \"身份 / 风控\"\n        - row \"hearts runtime/core/hearts/ SystemicScheduler ~1.2k LOC 双循环调度\":\n          - cell \"hearts\":\n            - code: hearts\n          - cell \"runtime/core/hearts/\":\n            - code: runtime/core/hearts/\n          - cell \"SystemicScheduler\":\n            - code: SystemicScheduler\n          - cell \"~1.2k LOC\"\n          - cell \"双循环调度\"\n        - row \"camouflage runtime/safety/camouflage/ StrategySelector ~1.8k LOC 策略 A/B\":\n          - cell \"camouflage\":\n            - code: camouflage\n          - cell \"runtime/safety/camouflage/\":\n            - code: runtime/safety/camouflage/\n          - cell \"StrategySelector\":\n            - code: StrategySelector\n          - cell \"~1.8k LOC\"\n          - cell \"策略 A/B\"\n        - row \"skin runtime/sensing/skin/ AmbientSensor ~1.1k LOC 被动环境感知\":\n          - cell \"skin\":\n            - code: skin\n          - cell \"runtime/sensing/skin/\":\n            - code: runtime/sensing/skin/\n          - cell \"AmbientSensor\":\n            - code: AmbientSensor\n          - cell \"~1.1k LOC\"\n          - cell \"被动环境感知\"\n        - row \"nerves runtime/core/nerves/ MessageBus / GraphExecutor ~0.5k LOC 消息总线 + hooks\":\n          - cell \"nerves\":\n            - code: nerves\n          - cell \"runtime/core/nerves/\":\n            - code: runtime/core/nerves/\n          - cell \"MessageBus / GraphExecutor\":\n            - code: MessageBus\n            - text: /\n            - code: GraphExecutor\n          - cell \"~0.5k LOC\"\n          - cell \"消息总线 + hooks\"\n        - row \"tentacle runtime/tentacle/ TentaclePool / MobileDevice ~2.1k LOC 移动 / 跨设备执行触点\":\n          - cell \"tentacle\":\n            - code: tentacle\n          - cell \"runtime/tentacle/\":\n            - code: runtime/tentacle/\n          - cell \"TentaclePool / MobileDevice\":\n            - code: TentaclePool\n            - text: /\n            - code: MobileDevice\n          - cell \"~2.1k LOC\"\n          - cell \"移动 / 跨设备执行触点\"\n    - paragraph: 特征：可以被同功能的实现替换；即使关闭某一个，系统在降级形态下仍能跑。\n    - heading \"基础设施 · Infrastructure （非器官）\" [level=3]\n    - blockquote:\n      - paragraph: 这些目录起了生物名只是叙事顺手，代码本质是基础设施 / 横切关注点 / 治理层。 新功能优先塞到这里，而不是开新器官。\n    - button \"Copy table as markdown\":\n    - button \"Download table\":\n    - table:\n      - rowgroup:\n        - row \"目录 性质 说明\":\n          - columnheader \"目录\"\n          - columnheader \"性质\"\n          - columnheader \"说明\"\n      - rowgroup:\n        - row \"runtime/platform/ 平台 config / ui / models / i18n / session —— 没有生物对应物\":\n          - cell \"runtime/platform/\":\n            - code: runtime/platform/\n          - cell \"平台\"\n          - cell \"config / ui / models / i18n / session —— 没有生物对应物\"\n        - row \"runtime/adapters/ 适配器 channels / integrations / mcp_client / scheduler —— 外部集成\":\n          - cell \"runtime/adapters/\":\n            - code: runtime/adapters/\n          - cell \"适配器\"\n          - cell \"channels / integrations / mcp_client / scheduler —— 外部集成\"\n        - row \"runtime/safety/gene_locks/ 治理 基因锁（IMMUTABLE / LEVEL / TEMPORAL / QUORUM / PANIC / MONOTONIC）\":\n          - cell \"runtime/safety/gene_locks/\":\n            - code: runtime/safety/gene_locks/\n          - cell \"治理\"\n          - cell \"基因锁（IMMUTABLE / LEVEL / TEMPORAL / QUORUM / PANIC / MONOTONIC）\"\n        - row \"runtime/safety/regeneration/ 治理 离线演化流水线（RecipeForge / 变体评估 / 自动提拔）\":\n          - cell \"runtime/safety/regeneration/\":\n            - code: runtime/safety/regeneration/\n          - cell \"治理\"\n          - cell \"离线演化流水线（RecipeForge / 变体评估 / 自动提拔）\"\n        - row \"runtime/safety/constitution/ 治理 宪法 / 边界声明\":\n          - cell \"runtime/safety/constitution/\":\n            - code: runtime/safety/constitution/\n          - cell \"治理\"\n          - cell \"宪法 / 边界声明\"\n        - row \"runtime/safety/invariants/ 治理 不变量检查器\":\n          - cell \"runtime/safety/invariants/\":\n            - code: runtime/safety/invariants/\n          - cell \"治理\"\n          - cell \"不变量检查器\"\n        - row \"runtime/safety/hooks/ 治理 执行前后钩子\":\n          - cell \"runtime/safety/hooks/\":\n            - code: runtime/safety/hooks/\n          - cell \"治理\"\n          - cell \"执行前后钩子\"\n        - row \"runtime/safety/chromatophores/ 基础设施 实际是 pub/sub + Boids 仲裁，跟\\\"色素细胞\\\"关系弱\":\n          - cell \"runtime/safety/chromatophores/\":\n            - code: runtime/safety/chromatophores/\n          - cell \"基础设施\"\n          - cell \"实际是 pub/sub + Boids 仲裁，跟\\\"色素细胞\\\"关系弱\"\n        - row \"runtime/safety/ink/ 基础设施 实际是 circuit breaker + 预算守卫\":\n          - cell \"runtime/safety/ink/\":\n            - code: runtime/safety/ink/\n          - cell \"基础设施\"\n          - cell \"实际是 circuit breaker + 预算守卫\"\n        - row \"runtime/sensing/siphon/ 基础设施 实际是 FastAPI 路由总线（10k 行），跟\\\"漏斗\\\"关系弱\":\n          - cell \"runtime/sensing/siphon/\":\n            - code: runtime/sensing/siphon/\n          - cell \"基础设施\"\n          - cell \"实际是 FastAPI 路由总线（10k 行），跟\\\"漏斗\\\"关系弱\"\n    - paragraph: 特征：\n    - list:\n      - listitem: 没有独立的领域概念\n      - listitem: 跨所有器官使用或服务所有器官\n      - listitem: 替换它们不动核心叙事\n    - separator\n    - heading \"新器官准入 · 三问\" [level=2]\n    - paragraph: 想新增器官？先回答：\n    - list:\n      - listitem: 它有独立的发布节奏吗？ 不同贡献者、不同版本演进速度？\n      - listitem: 它有独立的依赖边界吗？ import 箭头进出清晰，没有循环？\n      - listitem: 它有独立的失败模式吗？ 可以单独熔断 / 降级 / 重启？\n    - paragraph:\n      - text: 三个都 yes → 可以开新器官（走一等公民或辅助的命名规范） 有一个 no → 放到现有器官的子模块，或放\n      - code: platform/\n      - text: /\n      - code: adapters/\n      - text: /\n      - code: safety/\n    - separator\n    - heading \"现存不对齐清单 · Watch List\" [level=2]\n    - blockquote:\n      - paragraph: 这些是命名跟实际内容对不齐的已知问题，本轮不动（避免大重构）， 作为未来迭代的候选。每条注明\"什么信号触发动工\"。\n    - heading \"WL-1 · safety/chromatophores 可能需要并入 core/nerves\" [level=3]:\n      - text: WL-1 ·\n      - code: safety/chromatophores\n      - text: 可能需要并入\n      - code: core/nerves\n    - list:\n      - text: 现状：431 LOC，2 处外部 import，内容是\n      - code: SignalBus\n      - text: （pub/sub）+\n      - code: boids.py\n      - text: （避撞/对齐/聚合）\n      - text: 问题：\n      - code: core/nerves\n      - text: 里的\n      - code: MessageBus\n      - text: 职责高度重合；\"色素细胞\"生物叙事挂不住 pub/sub 代码\n      - text: 触发条件：当\n      - code: nerves.MessageBus\n      - text: 下次大改、或\n      - code: chromatophores\n      - text: 6 个月内无新增功能时合并\n      - text: 合并方案：\n      - code: runtime/core/nerves/signal_bus.py\n      - text: +\n      - code: runtime/core/nerves/boids.py\n    - heading \"WL-2 · safety/ink 可能需要降级为 safety/circuit_breaker.py\" [level=3]:\n      - text: WL-2 ·\n      - code: safety/ink\n      - text: 可能需要降级为\n      - code: safety/circuit_breaker.py\n    - list:\n      - text: 现状：294 LOC，2 处外部 import，内容是\n      - code: CircuitBreaker\n      - text: +\n      - code: BreakerModelRouter\n      - listitem: 问题：一个文件夹只放熔断器，器官粒度太细\n      - text: 触发条件：如果不再有\"预算硬顶\"之外的新功能加入，就拍扁成\n      - code: safety/circuit_breaker/\n      - text: （普通子模块命名）\n      - text: 合并方案：保留类名不变，只改文件夹路径；更新\n      - code: hearts.py\n      - text: 和\n      - code: tour.py\n      - text: 的 import\n    - heading \"WL-3 · sensing/siphon 需要迁到 platform/api/（大动作）\" [level=3]:\n      - text: WL-3 ·\n      - code: sensing/siphon\n      - text: 需要迁到\n      - code: platform/api/\n      - text: （大动作）\n    - list:\n      - text: 现状：10,118 LOC，17 个\n      - code: \"*_router.py\"\n      - text: （openai_gateway / channels / fs / mcp / observability / config / …）\n      - listitem: 问题：全是 FastAPI 路由，属于平台层而非感知层；\"漏斗喷水\"的生物隐喻跟 HTTP 路由完全错位\n      - text: 触发条件：下次有人要动路由聚合 / OpenAI 兼容层重构时，顺手挪到\n      - code: runtime/platform/api/\n      - text: 合并方案：\n      - button \"Download file\":\n      - button:\n      - code:\n        - generic: runtime/platform/api/ ← 新建\n        - generic: openai_gateway.py ← 从 siphon/\n        - generic: routers/\n        - generic: channels.py\n        - generic: fs.py\n        - generic: ... (17 个)\n        - generic: streaming_journal.py ← 从 siphon/\n      - text: 保留\n      - code: runtime/sensing/siphon/__init__.py\n      - text: 作 1-轮期的 shim（re-export + deprecation warning）\n    - heading \"WL-4 · memory/hemolymph 是否合并进 cerebrum？\" [level=3]:\n      - text: WL-4 ·\n      - code: memory/hemolymph\n      - text: 是否合并进\n      - code: cerebrum\n      - text: ？\n    - list:\n      - text: 现状：335 LOC，4 处外部 import，只有一个\n      - code: ContextComposer\n      - listitem: 问题：ContextComposer 永远跟 Planner 一起调用，没见过单独用\n      - text: 触发条件：如果未来一年 Blackboard（共享状态面）没真的落地，就并入\n      - code: cerebrum/context_composer.py\n      - listitem: 反方意见：目前的分离让 unit test 边界很干净，不强推\n    - separator\n    - heading \"跟现有文档的关系\" [level=2]\n    - button \"Copy table as markdown\":\n    - button \"Download table\":\n    - table:\n      - rowgroup:\n        - row \"文档 角色 本文件的关系\":\n          - columnheader \"文档\"\n          - columnheader \"角色\"\n          - columnheader \"本文件的关系\"\n      - rowgroup:\n        - row \"principles.md 六大原则 本文不改原则，只定义落地分层\":\n          - cell \"principles.md\":\n            - link \"principles.md\":\n              - /url: /principles.md\n              - code: principles.md\n          - cell \"六大原则\"\n          - cell \"本文不改原则，只定义落地分层\"\n        - row \"vision/biomimetic-architecture.md 总架构 + 器官映射 本文是其补充（tiering 层）\":\n          - cell \"vision/biomimetic-architecture.md\":\n            - link \"vision/biomimetic-architecture.md\":\n              - /url: /vision/biomimetic-architecture.md\n              - code: vision/biomimetic-architecture.md\n          - cell \"总架构 + 器官映射\"\n          - cell \"本文是其补充（tiering 层）\"\n        - row \"naming.md 双轨命名契约 本文不改命名，只给 20 个名字分级\":\n          - cell \"naming.md\":\n            - link \"naming.md\":\n              - /url: /naming.md\n              - code: naming.md\n          - cell \"双轨命名契约\"\n          - cell \"本文不改命名，只给 20 个名字分级\"\n        - row \"architecture/organs/*.md 每器官详述 本文的\\\"基础设施\\\"类目建议不再给它们写 organ.md\":\n          - cell \"architecture/organs/*.md\":\n            - link \"architecture/organs/*.md\":\n              - /url: /organs/\n              - code: architecture/organs/*.md\n          - cell \"每器官详述\"\n          - cell \"本文的\\\"基础设施\\\"类目建议不再给它们写 organ.md\"\n    - separator\n    - heading \"原则一句话\" [level=2]\n    - blockquote:\n      - paragraph: 20 是叙事数字，不是架构契约。一等公民 8 个，辅助器官 8 个，其余回归基础设施。\n      - paragraph: 下次有人问\"为什么 siphon 这么大而 hemolymph 这么小\"—— 答案是\"它们根本不在一个层\"。\n- region \"Notifications alt+T\""